From: AtomCode <noreply@atomgit.com>
Date: 2026-07-17
Subject: [PATCH] Add --disable-gui headless CLI build support

---
--- a/configure.ac	2026-07-18 11:11:29.352935000 +0800
+++ b/configure.ac	2026-07-18 11:11:29.352935000 +0800
@@ -50,21 +50,33 @@
